.. When a Real-Life Relative is recruited as a Time-Shifted Actor, to play a younger version of their older relative's character (parent-child relationships are the most common, but the trope also applies to nieces and nephews, or younger cousins and siblings).\\n\\n- All-Star Cast: A ... \",\"title\":\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/CharactersAndCasting\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"9ffd636a5993fd5733905bfd115072c274b46fb55112a3cbff1e0a24e2106fc1\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"e4f379196aab7b857cda7d54578742d52e23a435192f07a84b099784d6365733\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"actress real life relative co-star unrelated character TV series married three times one child survives\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d6\"},\"ref\":\"d6\",\"snippet\":\" ... He made his first appearance with Gene Wilder in the very popular action/comedy Silver Streak (1976), played three different characters in Which Way Is Up? (1977) and portrayed real-life stock-car driver \\\"Wendell Scott\\\" in Greased Lightning (1977). Proving he was more than just a comedian ... \",\"title\":\"https://m.imdb.com/search/name/?death_date=2005&ref_=nmbio\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d12\"},\"ref\":\"d12\",\"snippet\":\" ... Parker's stardom and subsequent fame (and remembrance) suffered from her focusing on being a serious actress and creating a character who fit the motion picture she was in, rather than playing a character over and over, as most actors do. She probably best remembered for the relatively ... \",\"titl