ur Life (1955) on two separate occasions, the actor survived two major heart attacks before dying of pneumonia at age 79 on November 16, 2009, in Cornwall, England.- Actress\\n\\n- Soundtrack\\n\\nAnne Francis got into show business ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.imdb.com/search/name/?birth_year=1930\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d20\"},\"ref\":\"d20\",\"snippet\":\" ... Nonetheless, the show lasted only 60 performances and closed on January 6, 1945. In 1945, Havoc was featured in the film Brewster's Millions, and starred in The Ryan Girl on Broadway.\\n\\nIn Hollywood, Havoc played the second female lead for three of the most popular musical movie ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/June_Havoc\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d179\"},\"ref\":\"d179\",\"snippet\":\" ... Nixon), \\\"Fiddler on the Roof\\\" (with his wife) and \\\"No, No, Nanette\\\". Gene also appeared in his one-man cabaret show entitled \\\"Gene Barry in One\\\" from time to time.\\n\\nIn later years he made only occasional TV and stage appearances (bringing back his famous characters Bat Masterson ... \",\"title\":\"https://m.imdb.com/search/name/?death_date=2009&ref_=nm_ov_dth_year\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d180\"},\"ref\":\"d180\",\"snippet\":\" ... He is survived by his wife Tova, their children and his younger sister Evelyn (1926-2013)- Cute, tiny, and prolific little old lady character actress Frances Bay worked constantly in both films and TV shows alike after making her debut at the age of 59 in life with ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.imdb.com/search/name/?birth_date=1910-01-01%2C1919-12-31\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_no